  "description": "Calibrated judgments over HTTP for Webority.Ai.Judgment: one handler a product maps on its own route, so browsers and mobile apps reach extract and classify through the product's own auth and rate limiting. The browser sends only text and field names; the exposed uses, patterns and categories come from configuration, the actor from the signed-in user, and failures answer as JSON with a fixed code.",
